{"id":"a1ee1710d1781383","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/744_DLP_描述逻辑程序.md","title":"744 DLP 描述逻辑程序","display":"744_DLP_描述逻辑程序","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"744-DLP-描述逻辑程序\">744 DLP 描述逻辑程序</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R,N_I,\\mathsf{Var})\">\\(\\Sigma=(N_C,N_R,N_I,\\mathsf{Var})\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_C\">\\(N_C\\)</span> 是一元谓词名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_R\">\\(N_R\\)</span> 是二元谓词名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_I\">\\(N_I\\)</span> 是常元名集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}=\\{x_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span> 是变量集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_I\\cap\\mathsf{Var}=\\varnothing\">\\(N_I\\cap\\mathsf{Var}=\\varnothing\\)</span>，且枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0,x_1,\\ldots\">\\(x_0,x_1,\\ldots\\)</span> 无重复。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_I\">\\(N_I\\)</span> 可以为空；不额外假定存在常元。</p>\n<p>项与原子构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{const},\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{catom},\\operatorname{ratom}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{const},\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{catom},\\operatorname{ratom}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{const}:N_I\\to\\mathsf{Term},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{var}:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Term},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{const}:N_I\\to\\mathsf{Term},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{var}:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Term},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{catom}:N_C\\times\\mathsf{Term}\\to\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ratom}:N_R\\times\\mathsf{Term}\\times\\mathsf{Term}\\to\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{catom}:N_C\\times\\mathsf{Term}\\to\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ratom}:N_R\\times\\mathsf{Term}\\times\\mathsf{Term}\\to\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{catom}(A,t)\">\\(\\operatorname{catom}(A,t)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(t)\">\\(A(t)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ratom}(R,s,t)\">\\(\\operatorname{ratom}(R,s,t)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(s,t)\">\\(R(s,t)\\)</span>。规则构造子的安全定义在第 3 节给出。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与原子\">2. 项与原子</h1>\n<p>项构造子是两个不交载体的包含映射：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{const}(a)=a\">\\(\\operatorname{const}(a)=a\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var}(x)=x\">\\(\\operatorname{var}(x)=x\\)</span>。项集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}=N_I\\cup\\mathsf{Var}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Term}=N_I\\cup\\mathsf{Var}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原子集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\)</span> 是由下列条款生成的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in N_C\">\\(A\\in N_C\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(t)\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\">\\(A(t)\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in N_R\">\\(R\\in N_R\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\">\\(R(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>自由变量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Term}\\cup\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Term}\\cup\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\\)</span> 在项上的条款为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(t)=\\{t\\}\\cap\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(t)=\\{t\\}\\cap\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>，在原子上的条款为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(A(t))=\\{t\\}\\cap\\mathsf{Var},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(R(s,t))=(\\{s,t\\}\\cap\\mathsf{Var}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(A(t))=\\{t\\}\\cap\\mathsf{Var},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(R(s,t))=(\\{s,t\\}\\cap\\mathsf{Var}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-规则语法\">3. 规则语法</h1>\n<p>有限原子列集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Body}\">\\(\\mathsf{Body}\\)</span> 是满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta:k\\to\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\">\\(\\beta:k\\to\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 的所有有限函数组成的最小集合，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。DLP 规则集合为：</p>\n<p>定义安全规则输入载体：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SafeClauseInput}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\n=\n\\left\\{\n(\\beta,H)\\in\\mathsf{Body}\\times\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}:\n\\operatorname{FV}(H)\n\\subseteq\n\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\beta)}\\operatorname{FV}(B)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SafeClauseInput}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\n=\n\\left\\{\n(\\beta,H)\\in\\mathsf{Body}\\times\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}:\n\\operatorname{FV}(H)\n\\subseteq\n\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\beta)}\\operatorname{FV}(B)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则载体与构造子定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\n=\n\\mathsf{SafeClauseInput}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\n=\n\\mathsf{SafeClauseInput}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{clause}:\n\\mathsf{SafeClauseInput}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{clause}(\\beta,H)=(\\beta,H).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{clause}:\n\\mathsf{SafeClauseInput}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\n\\to\n\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{clause}(\\beta,H)=(\\beta,H).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\beta,H)\">\\((\\beta,H)\\)</span> 显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\leftarrow B_0,\\ldots,B_{k-1}\">\\(H\\leftarrow B_0,\\ldots,B_{k-1}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-替换与实例\">4. 替换与实例</h1>\n<p>定义新变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshVar}(X)=x_m,\n\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin X\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshVar}(X)=x_m,\n\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{i:x_i\\notin X\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 有限。DLP 规则没有量词绑定构造子；变量只由替换实例化。绑定变量函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(t)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(A)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\beta,H)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(t)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(A)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\beta,H)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此捕获避免替换就是本节的分子句替换，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{DLP}}Y\\Longleftrightarrow X=Y\n\\quad\n(X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Term}\\cup\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\cup\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{DLP}}Y\\Longleftrightarrow X=Y\n\\quad\n(X,Y\\in\\mathsf{Term}\\cup\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\cup\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项替换是函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span>。其项扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta:\\mathsf{Term}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\">\\(\\widehat\\theta:\\mathsf{Term}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\theta(a)=a\\ (a\\in N_I),\\qquad \\widehat\\theta(x)=\\theta(x)\\ (x\\in\\mathsf{Var}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\theta(a)=a\\ (a\\in N_I),\\qquad \\widehat\\theta(x)=\\theta(x)\\ (x\\in\\mathsf{Var}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原子替换：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta(A(t))=A(\\widehat\\theta(t)),\n\\qquad\n\\theta(R(s,t))=R(\\widehat\\theta(s),\\widehat\\theta(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta(A(t))=A(\\widehat\\theta(t)),\n\\qquad\n\\theta(R(s,t))=R(\\widehat\\theta(s),\\widehat\\theta(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则实例为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta(\\beta,H)=(\\theta(\\beta),\\theta(H)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta(\\beta,H)=(\\theta(\\beta),\\theta(H)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta=(B_0,\\ldots,B_{k-1})\">\\(\\beta=(B_0,\\ldots,B_{k-1})\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta(\\beta)=(\\theta(B_0),\\ldots,\\theta(B_{k-1})).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta(\\beta)=(\\theta(B_0),\\ldots,\\theta(B_{k-1})).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\n=\n\\{(\\widehat\\theta,\\theta_{\\mathsf A},\\theta_{\\mathsf C}):\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\n=\n\\{(\\widehat\\theta,\\theta_{\\mathsf A},\\theta_{\\mathsf C}):\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to\\mathsf{Term}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathsf A}:\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\to\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathsf A}:\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\to\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathsf C}:\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\to\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathsf C}:\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\to\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathsf A}(A)=\\theta(A)\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathsf A}(A)=\\theta(A)\\)</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\)</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{\\mathsf C}(\\beta,H)=\\theta(\\beta,H)\">\\(\\theta_{\\mathsf C}(\\beta,H)=\\theta(\\beta,H)\\)</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\beta,H)\\in\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\">\\((\\beta,H)\\in\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\)</span> 成立。</p>\n<p>上述子句扩张保持安全性：若某变量出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(H)\">\\(\\theta(H)\\)</span>，它来自原头中某变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的像 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x)\">\\(\\theta(x)\\)</span>；安全性使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 也出现在某个体原子中，因此该像中的变量也出现在替换后的体中。无绑定符号，alpha 等价只使用本节前面已经给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}\\cup\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\cup\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}\\cup\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\cup\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\)</span> 上的恒等关系，不另行缩小其域。</p>\n<p>因此捕获避免条件为空条件，变量替换完全由上面的项替换函数给出。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-程序与事实\">5. 程序与事实</h1>\n<p>DLP 程序是有限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\">\\(\\mathcal P\\subseteq\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\)</span>。事实集合是有限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\)</span>，且只允许闭原子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{GAtom}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}:\\operatorname{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{GAtom}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}:\\operatorname{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-公理集合\">6. 公理集合</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F)\n=\n\\mathcal F\n\\cup\n\\{\\theta(H):(\\beta,H)\\in\\mathcal P,\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to N_I,\\operatorname{rng}(\\theta(\\beta))\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F)\n=\n\\mathcal F\n\\cup\n\\{\\theta(H):(\\beta,H)\\in\\mathcal P,\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to N_I,\\operatorname{rng}(\\theta(\\beta))\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该公理集合只包含可直接由输入事实触发的一步规则头；迭代触发由规则关系处理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-推理规则\">7. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>DLP 立即后继规则关系定义如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}:\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}})\n\\to\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{GAtom}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{GAtom}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}:\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}})\n\\to\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{GAtom}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{GAtom}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P)\n=\n\\{((B_0,\\ldots,B_{k-1}),H):\n(\\beta,H_0)\\in\\mathcal P,\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to N_I,\\theta(\\beta)=(B_0,\\ldots,B_{k-1}),H=\\theta(H_0)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P)\n=\n\\{((B_0,\\ldots,B_{k-1}),H):\n(\\beta,H_0)\\in\\mathcal P,\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to N_I,\\theta(\\beta)=(B_0,\\ldots,B_{k-1}),H=\\theta(H_0)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_i,H\">\\(B_i,H\\)</span> 均为闭原子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-证明对象\">8. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F)\\)</span> 为所有从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F)\">\\((\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F)\\)</span> 出发的非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span> 的集合，使得每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，且每行至少满足下列条件之一（析取许可）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F)\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_0,\\ldots,j_{k-1}&lt;i\">\\(j_0,\\ldots,j_{k-1}&lt;i\\)</span>，使\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_{j_0},\\ldots,A_{j_{k-1}}),A_i)\n\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P)\">\\(((A_{j_0},\\ldots,A_{j_{k-1}}),A_i)\n\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义证明谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F,\\pi,A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F,\\pi,A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F)\\)</span> 且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-可导出关系\">9. 可导出关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F\\vdash_{\\mathsf{DLP}}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F\\vdash_{\\mathsf{DLP}}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F\\vdash_{\\mathsf{DLP}}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists \\pi\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F)\\,\n(m&gt;0\\land\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\land A_{m-1}=A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F\\vdash_{\\mathsf{DLP}}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists \\pi\\in\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F)\\,\n(m&gt;0\\land\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\land A_{m-1}=A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-立即后继算子与最小闭包\">10. 立即后继算子与最小闭包</h1>\n<p>定义知识库载体：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\n=\n\\{(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F):\\mathcal P\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathcal F\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\n=\n\\{(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F):\\mathcal P\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathcal F\\subseteq_{\\mathrm{fin}}\\mathsf{GAtom}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 Herbrand 结构集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{GAtom}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{GAtom}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F)\\in\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\">\\((\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F)\\in\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\)</span> 定义立即后继算子</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{GAtom})\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{GAtom})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{GAtom})\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{GAtom})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}(X)\n=\nX\\cup\\mathcal F\\cup\n\\{\\theta(H):(\\beta,H)\\in\\mathcal P,\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to N_I,\\operatorname{rng}(\\theta(\\beta))\\subseteq X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}(X)\n=\nX\\cup\\mathcal F\\cup\n\\{\\theta(H):(\\beta,H)\\in\\mathcal P,\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to N_I,\\operatorname{rng}(\\theta(\\beta))\\subseteq X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义迭代：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}^{0}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}^{0}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}^{n+1}\n=\n\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}(\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}^{n}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}^{n+1}\n=\n\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}(\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}^{n}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义最小闭包：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lfp}(\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F})\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}^{n}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lfp}(\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F})\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}^{n}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-满足关系与语义后承\">11. 满足关系与语义后承</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{GAtom}\\)</span> 定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对事实集定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\mathcal F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\mathcal F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal F\\subseteq X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对规则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\beta,H)\\in\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\">\\((\\beta,H)\\in\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\)</span> 定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\beta,H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}(\\beta,H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to N_I\">\\(\\theta:\\mathsf{Var}\\to N_I\\)</span>，若</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rng}(\\theta(\\beta))\\subseteq X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rng}(\\theta(\\beta))\\subseteq X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\theta(H)\\in X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\theta(H)\\in X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\mathcal P\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\mathcal P\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathcal P\">\\(r\\in\\mathcal P\\)</span> 均有</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}r.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}r.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{DLP}}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{DLP}}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\)</span>，若</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\mathcal P\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\nX\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\mathcal F,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\mathcal P\n\\quad\\text{且}\\quad\nX\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\\mathcal F,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>最小闭包后承定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F\\Vdash^{\\operatorname{lfp}}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F\\Vdash^{\\operatorname{lfp}}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\operatorname{lfp}(\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\operatorname{lfp}(\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"12.-特征差异\">12. 特征差异</h1>\n<p>DLP 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{hornClause},\\operatorname{groundAtom},\\operatorname{leastClosure}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{conceptInclusion},\\operatorname{roleInclusion},\\operatorname{aboxAssertion}\\}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{hornClause},\\operatorname{groundAtom},\\operatorname{leastClosure}\\},\n\\{\\operatorname{conceptInclusion},\\operatorname{roleInclusion},\\operatorname{aboxAssertion}\\}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一分量要求对象为 Horn 规则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\leftarrow B_0,\\ldots,B_{k-1}\">\\(H\\leftarrow B_0,\\ldots,B_{k-1}\\)</span> 与闭原子最小闭包，主判断落在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{GAtom}\">\\(\\mathsf{GAtom}\\)</span> 上。</p>\n<h1 id=\"13.-整个形式系统\">13. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{DLP}}=(N_C,N_R,N_I,\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Term},\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf{GAtom},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F},\\operatorname{lfp},\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\Vdash^{\\operatorname{lfp}}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{DLP}}=(N_C,N_R,N_I,\\mathsf{Var},\\mathsf{Term},\\mathsf{Atom}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf{GAtom},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf{KB}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\mathsf T_{\\mathcal P,\\mathcal F},\\operatorname{lfp},\\models_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{DLP}},\\Vdash^{\\operatorname{lfp}}_{\\mathsf{DLP}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义 Horn 程序、有限推导、Herbrand 结构与最小闭包后承；不含查询优化、数据库物理计划或复杂度元定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"744-DLP-描述逻辑程序","text":"744 DLP 描述逻辑程序","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与原子","text":"2. 项与原子","level":1},{"id":"3.-规则语法","text":"3. 规则语法","level":1},{"id":"4.-替换与实例","text":"4. 替换与实例","level":1},{"id":"5.-程序与事实","text":"5. 程序与事实","level":1},{"id":"6.-公理集合","text":"6. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"7.-推理规则","text":"7. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"8.-证明对象","text":"8. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"9.-可导出关系","text":"9. 可导出关系","level":1},{"id":"10.-立即后继算子与最小闭包","text":"10. 立即后继算子与最小闭包","level":1},{"id":"11.-满足关系与语义后承","text":"11. 满足关系与语义后承","level":1},{"id":"12.-特征差异","text":"12. 特征